  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Implement Brexit with no extension; strong defence and veterans’ package (exceed NATO 2%, nuclear deterrent, Space Command, extensive veteran support); tougher policing and sentencing with 20,000 more officers and 10,000 prison places; Australian-style points-based immigration with stricter eligibility; Union emphasis and voter ID; substantial NHS expansion (50,000 nurses, 6,000 GPs) and mental health reforms; net‑zero by 2050, fracking moratorium, major efficiency funding. TEXT_F: Extensive care/equality measures (National Care Service with free personal care; free prescriptions and basic dentistry; end rough sleeping; Right to Food; 1m social homes; rent controls; free school meals; abolish tuition fees; £10 living wage; ban zero‑hours; 32‑hour week); strong environmental agenda (90% low‑carbon electricity by 2030; ban fracking; climate emergency bill); constitutional reforms (abolish House of Lords; votes at 16); maintain NATO 2% and nuclear but soften immigration stance and propose a confirmatory referendum.",
